{"duration_api_ms":122844,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a91a3efa-2ec5-4f7e-bd01-d5d5b186b129","total_cost_usd":1.163522,"usage":{"input_tokens":48,"cache_creation_input_tokens":71728,"cache_read_input_tokens":1741730,"output_tokens":12058,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1534},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":71728,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":992,"cache_read_input_tokens":87233,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1319,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1319},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5[1m]":{"inputTokens":48,"outputTokens":12058,"cacheReadInputTokens":1741730,"cacheCreationInputTokens":71728,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.163522,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1534,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":27,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I did the photo-matching step. The Main Concourse colours now match real photos of Grand Central: the vault is teal, the walls honey-coloured stone, the floor pale and the windows sky-blue. The map compiles and loads in Garry's Mod.\n\n- **Reference photos:** 10 licensed Wikimedia Commons photos are in [refs/photos](refs/photos), with authors and licences listed in [refs/SOURCES.md](refs/SOURCES.md). Several are CC BY or BY-SA, so they will need credit in the Workshop description. A new script, [tools/fetch_refs.py](tools/fetch_refs.py), downloads them.\n- **Surface colours:** five custom materials in [src/materials/gcs](src/materials/gcs) tint the stock HL2 textures to colours sampled from the photos. The compile script now packs them into the map file, so they will ship with it.\n- **Comparison sheets:** a new script, [tools/compare.py](tools/compare.py), puts each screenshot beside a photo taken from roughly the same spot. The latest is [shots/20261123-1731/compare.jpg](shots/20261123-1731/compare.jpg).\n- **Fixes along the way:**\n  - The first window glow showed the missing-texture checker; it now uses the right stock texture.\n  - Two screenshot runs came back empty because an installed addon takes about 60 seconds to load. The screenshot script now waits up to 5 minutes.\n\nThe comparison sheet shows the main gaps are now shape, not colour. The map still lacks the pillars and deep window bays along the long walls, the gilded band where the ceiling starts, the half-moon windows cut into the ceiling, the window bars and a flatter ceiling curve. Those are first in [HANDOFF.md](ai-docs/HANDOFF.md). After them come real photo-based textures (marble, stone blocks, the zodiac ceiling) and the clock on the information booth.\n\nNothing is waiting on you. Your sign-off on the look comes once those shapes are in.\n\nI did not run the evergreen wrap-up this session. The log and HANDOFF.md are up to date.\n\nFrom the startup notice: three askwright answer sets have gone unprocessed for over a week: \"Atlas Lite card art 1\", \"Card art 2026-11-12-ship-blockout 1\" and \"Design: once-per-turn building use\". Each needs to be consumed or dismissed.\n\nNext session, start in [gcs-gmod](./), prompt: [2026-11-23-gcs-gmod-continue-prompt.md](ai-docs/plans/2026-11-23-gcs-gmod-continue-prompt.md)\n`Execute D:/m4bwa/Claude/Projects/Ai/gcs-gmod/ai-docs/plans/2026-11-23-gcs-gmod-continue-prompt.md`","ttft_ms":4227,"type":"result","duration_ms":886098,"uuid":"7d950854-0e10-4194-b806-ecd19d2394bb","ttft_stream_ms":3173,"time_to_request_ms":292,"first_content_frame_ms":3173,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}

